{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b5639f2be0894ffd","name":"Orbalisk Armor","source":{"id":"source:reference-b5639f2be0894ffd","title":"Orbalisk Armor","revision":18988,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:05:36Z","sha256":"3a0282c17d1d7616103a1c48c7f3e5ee3628035e9fb8da0a5c871461e7855204","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18988","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Orbalisk%20Armor&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b5639f2be0894ffd","blocks":[{"tag":"h4","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Orbalisk Armor is unique in that it can only be obtained by subjecting oneself to parasites known as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Orbalisks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Orbalisks?action=edit&redlink=1"},", native to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dxun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dxun","referenceId":"reference:fe72b3042330089a"},". The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Orbalisks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Orbalisks?action=edit&redlink=1"}," bond with the host and usually drain the host of energy; however, someone with sufficient strength in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," (that is, possessing a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"}," equal to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"}," score) can prevent the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Orbalisks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Orbalisks?action=edit&redlink=1"}," from killing them, instead forming a symbiotic relationship with the parasites.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A character with Orbalisk Armor gains ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"}," 10; unlike normal DR, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"}," do not ignore the DR of the Orbalisk Armor. Since Orbalisk Armor is bonded directly to the skin of the wearer, it cannot be removed except through complex medical procedures (requiring ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surgery"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surgery"},", as per the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," skill). However, since Orbalisk Armor is not worn in the traditional sense, the wearer takes no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor Check Penalty"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor_Check_Penalty"}," on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"}," for not beings proficient in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Armor","referenceId":"reference:4bc2d20a5687b54f"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Armor","referenceId":"reference:4bc2d20a5687b54f"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},":"]}," +10\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},":"]}," +2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Maximum ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," Bonus:"]}," +1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 26 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rare"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rare"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When on the moon ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dxun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dxun","referenceId":"reference:fe72b3042330089a"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darth Bane"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darth_Bane","referenceId":"reference:16f1400dee26a7e1"}," stumbled upon a dormant colony of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Orbalisks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Orbalisks?action=edit&redlink=1"},". These parasitic creatures, exclusive to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dxun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dxun","referenceId":"reference:fe72b3042330089a"},", feed by attaching themselves to a host. As a byproduct of their parasitism, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Orbalisks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Orbalisks?action=edit&redlink=1"}," form a dense plating that protects their host- an armor of exceptional strength even against ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When a host is covered in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Orbalisks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Orbalisks?action=edit&redlink=1"},", the creatures grant ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"}," 10 to that individual. Unlike normal forms of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"},", the Orbalisks' protection applies even to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},":"]}," +10\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
